(2)  Even where a person who established and operates a foreign establishment under Article 12 (1) of the Act fails to register the foreign establishment pursuant to Article 12, an importer, etc. may make an import declaration of livestock products processed at the relevant foreign establishment pursuant to Article 27 for up to six months from the date this Rule enters into force. 
